  "description": "The META V5 RIDE benefits from a duo of ROCKSHOX suspension and SRAM components.\n• Up front, the 160mm Lyrik has been completely redesigned with a new chassis, a new DebonAir + spring, and a new Rush RC hydraulic cartridge. On the back we've installed a Deluxe Select+. Negative and positive air volumes can be adjusted, and the end of travel is also better managed.\n• SRAM DB8s are designed for intensive use and offer consistent performance.\n• The wheels are built with SPANK Spike Race 33 rims and FORMULA hubs. This assembly is robust and offers great Grip.\n• A SRAM NX Eagle drivetrain features an ultra-wide gear range for uphill slopes.",
